™s very earnest way of looking at daily life, and I hoped to achieve that on this record,â€ says Wedl, calling from her Nashville home, surrounded by vintage magazines and tchotchkes. Wedl is warm and dudely; she answers almost every question with an exuberant â€œ<em>toootally!</em>â€. She cites her favourite of her new songs, the absurdly immediate Just Another Daddy Who Did Me Wrong, a bittersweet number that questions her self-destructive appeal. â€œItâ€™s a very harsh look at reality, but also about how our minds can create so much fantasy around reality. Iâ€™m working on not projecting too much on reality these days.â€</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/23/brennan-wedl-on-freeing-herself-through-song">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-uXrfBSCZeLOpczXZRcE1Urd0v7oyaPkyB_XtWIjIyMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;1kFngwo42mSpGX2XyuyXRkLygdsiCRKZ8XYrQ3LqWicƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qiBIF9wz_ctbwC8IZ9_ucXkrJ8uBvZPUT8aspg9Epbsƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;e6JT-Alah4aKGjnbjaT9vVNe7E1PAQoM7RTNseN1Eo0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;YSTmoTYUSPE7NeQ_zdJvPu_tuQdy9Wpm2P_FM6ccf8sƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;mkjM0pmxo50UKrQHAvIBQUU7dTmttHVYZ9upyyUXnYcƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;luqUlVBRQslLihRh4zk-zOIIxYlHlvHRxq1Qiph8swQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dba