uberant â€œ<em>toootally!</em>â€. She cites her favourite of her new songs, the absurdly immediate Just Another Daddy Who Did Me Wrong, a bittersweet number that questions her self-destructive appeal. â€œItâ€™s a very harsh look at reality, but also about how our minds can create so much fantasy around reality. Iâ€™m working on not projecting too much on reality these days.â€</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/23/brennan-wedl-on-freeing-herself-through-song">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;HWqCEay5pVdPSXxIXKAvnDraK2AmsUxufSVNVzCFwycƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx†â€˜My lifeâ€™s work was being delightful. That really hurt meâ€™: breakout Americana star Brennan Wedl on freeing herself through songƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EudhLawAjs8P071dieX-9EuhNzBvqXqIqE-cz9Xhj7gƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;73ZjUH9rUP0UtpxjLL0tGfwi4mDuw4_yxjnU-b7rsYsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxZhttps://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/23/brennan-wedl-on-freeing-herself-through-songƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;yxVs-4XwfFCYjt7ALeI0EgKO0cYvRTN5P6fxcU_QsKAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx_my-life-s-work-was-being-delightful-that-really-hurt-me-breakout-americana-star-brennan-wedl-onƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;k8AaGcq8IsrEna-l2aQJlmtTcIYjTUW49QTj1d-x_0gƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;R-GCPl-XOm3km-qaSoblBR1fvB7MNbWXwHxj07adKrUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunit